  "paid_author_reason": "Continuation reuses the prior skeleton, bindings, and overall toy_dance structure, adjusting only fields tied to measured failures. (1) Exported coat artifacts (stubbly tips/speckling and crown lump): shortened and widened portable tuft-v1 cards (same 3825 count to preserve budget) and set fur_clump to 0 to reduce clumpy speckle; slightly broadened head_crown flow blending to soften the localized crown ridge. (2) Possible dragon/arm weight leakage contributing to export-side breakup: removed dragon bones from the whole-body fallback weight layer and tightened the dragon and arm spatial layers to reduce unintended influence outside their regions; additionally tightened the hand_r constraint ellipsoid to suppress demonstrated torso-side hand_r leakage. (3) Readable hops: increased root vertical translation peaks at beats (1s/2s/3s) while preserving timing, return-to-start, and all articulation roles.",
